DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nThe Art of Prioritisation\nSynopsis\n:\nLearn to thri
	ve in today’s fast-paced work with The Art of Prioritisation. Join this 
	session if you want to:\n1. Prioritise and enhance everyday decision-makin
	g\n2. Uncover the secrets to effective workload management\n3. Optimise yo
	ur workflow with Agile Prioritisation techniques\nSpeaker\n:\nJurgen J MEE
	RSCHAEGE\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n\nJoin via Laptop\n\n*As a fi
	rst time participant using DBS laptop\, you must follow this [​mp4 icon]
	  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4<https://dbs1bank-my.sharepoint
	.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10Bd_0ordpIVCH
	SxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2> guide prior to the event. This will install Webex Me
	eting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming experience!\n\n  
	1.  On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex Events URL<ht
	tps://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e3cf8eeba38e206605d89de4272e0e8
	da>\n  2.  Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address and click on 
	[Join Now]\n\n\nJoin via Mobile Device\n\n  1.  Download Webex Meetings Ap
	p from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meeting & Input 
	Meeting Number: 2514 051 6829\n\n  1.  Input Password 1234\n\n\nJoin via P
	hone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +852-3018-6828
	 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +91-40-6480-0
	114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2514 051 6829\nGlobal call-in numb
	ers<https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e676867362e0173666ba58
	56cc26881d5>\n\n\n\n\n\n
